<view class="page backup-page">
  <view class="backup-reminder">联系人只保存在当前手机。建议定期导出加密备份，换手机、清理微信数据或恢复旧备份前先备份最新数据。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="backup-status" role="status">{{busyMessage}}</view>
  <view class="section-title">导出加密备份</view>
  <view class="backup-section">
    <input disabled="{{busy}}" password value="{{exportPassword}}" bindinput="exportPasswordInput" placeholder="设置至少10位备份密码" maxlength="64" />
    <button class="primary-button" bindtap="exportData" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">生成并分享备份文件</button>
    <text>密码不会上传到服务器。请把备份文件保存在微信之外的安全位置，并记住密码。</text>
  </view>
  <view class="section-title">从文件恢复</view>
  <view class="backup-section">
    <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="chooseFile" disabled="{{busy}}">选择备份文件</button>
    <text wx:if="{{selectedName}}">{{selectedName}}</text>
    <input disabled="{{busy}}" password value="{{importPassword}}" bindinput="importPasswordInput" placeholder="输入备份密码" maxlength="64" />
    <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="inspect" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !selectedPath}}">查看备份内容</button>
  </view>
  <view class="backup-section preview" wx:if="{{preview}}">
    <view class="preview-title">恢复预览</view>
    <view><text>当前手机</text><text>{{preview.currentContacts}} 位联系人 · {{preview.currentRelationships}} 条关系</text></view>
    <view><text>备份文件</text><text>{{preview.backupContacts}} 位联系人 · {{preview.backupRelationships}} 条关系</text></view>
    <text>恢复将完整替换当前账号的本机资料和关系，不会合并同名联系人。</text>
    <button class="danger-button" bindtap="restoreData" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">确认恢复</button>
  </view>
  <privacy-popup />
</view>
